Code that caused this failure:

```js
// Use instead of importing 'util'
import * as util from './lib/node/util';
export {util};
// TODO - remove
export {promisify} from './lib/node/util';

// Use instead of importing 'fs';`
import * as fs from './lib/node/fs';
export {fs};
```

https://github.com/visgl/loaders.gl/blob/4fe0724b942697a95ff3eb3af47b7a7c18556c52/modules/loader-utils/src/index.ts#L87-L95

These `./lib/node/*` modules are mapped to `false` via `browser` field, and it works fine with star import. But breaks when importing code references named exports.
